{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14962","headline":"宿石瓮寺 · 卢纶","name":"宿石瓮寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"殿有寒灯草有萤，千林万壑寂无声。\n烟凝积水龙蛇蛰，露湿空山星汉明。\n昏霭雾中悲世界，曙霞光里见王城。\n回瞻相好因垂泪，苦海波涛何日平。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢纶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14962.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14962","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}